  "details": "2020.3.3 update causes VRChat to get stuck in the loading screen if the world ID in the launch options is invalid.\nSteps to reproduce:\nLaunch VRChat through CMD:\nVRChat.exe --no-vr \"vrchat://launch?ref=vrchat.com&id=wrld_invalid\"\nLaunching with a valid world ID works:\nVRChat.exe --no-vr \"vrchat://launch?ref=vrchat.com&id=wrld_bbdc2259-c4c2-46ce-90a9-e3ebbd272a9a\"\nBefore 2020.3.3, VRChat would just drop you into an invite+ instance of your home world\n---output log---\n2020.09.18 23:45:13 Error      -  [API] [6, 404, Get, 2] Request Finished with Error!\nhttps://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/worlds/wrld_invalid?apiKey=JlE5Jldo5Jibnk5O5hTx6XVqsJu4WJ26&organization=vrchat\nNo Exception\n{{\"error\":{{\"message\":\"\\\"World wrld_invalid not found\\\"\",\"status_code\":404}}}}\n2020.09.18 23:45:13 Error      -  [VRCFlowManagerVRC] Couldn't fetch world wrld_invalid: - \"World wrld_invalid not found\"",
